# ============================================================
# 存档仓库 .gitignore —— 只存代码/报告/配置/图表，不存大文件
# 大文件（权重/数据/打包产物）留在服务器，路径写进 md/README
# ============================================================

# ----- 权重 / 模型检查点 -----
*.pt
*.pth
*.ckpt
*.safetensors
*.onnx
*.engine
*.ref32ep
*.pkl

# ----- 数据 / 二进制结果 -----
*.npy
*.npz
*.h5
*.hdf5
*.parquet
*.bin
*.mat
*.wav
*.iq
*.raw
*.sigmf
*.sigmf-data
*.sigmf-meta

# ----- 日志 / 缓存 -----
*.log
*.out
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
*.egg-info/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# ----- 打包产物 -----
*.zip
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.tgz
*.gz
*.7z
*.rar

# ----- 逐样本评估/预测产物（留在服务器，路径写在 md 里）-----
**/eval_cases.jsonl
**/extended_cases.jsonl
**/test_cases.jsonl
**/eval_val/results.json
**/eval_val/partial.json
**/perturbation_predictions/
**/denoise_eval_round2.json

# ----- 每 run 训练历史 / 生成式 campaign 计划 -----
**/history.jsonl
**/plan/plan.json

# ----- per-job/per-run 生成产物（由 results_summary / run_manifest / report.md 汇总）-----
**/metrics.json
**/DONE.json
**/environment.json
**/provenance.json
**/best_val.json
**/best_metrics.json
**/model_info.json
**/parameter_counts.json
**/registry.json
**/metadata.json
**/pre_*.json

# ----- 临时 / 系统 -----
*.pid
.DS_Store
*~
